Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; =============================================================================
; QALQON ROBOT — FIX WINDOWS SERIAL MOUSE JUMPING BUG FOR LIDAR STL-19P
; Ushbu sozlama Windows'ning qadimgi "Serial Mouse" (sermouse) drayverini o'chiradi.
; Natijada LiDAR yuborayotgan ma'lumotlar sichqoncha harakati deb qabul qilinmaydi!
; =============================================================================

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services\sermouse]
"Start"=dword:00000004
